Feature: Editing todos
  As a TodoMVC user
  I want to edit existing todos inline
  So that I can correct mistakes

  Scenario: Editing saves on Enter
    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
    And I am editing todo "Buy milk"
    When I clear the edit input
    And I type "Buy bread" in the edit input
    And I press Enter
    Then todo "Buy bread" exists in the list
    And todo "Buy milk" does not exist

  Scenario: Editing saves on blur
    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
    And I am editing todo "Buy milk"
    When I clear the edit input
    And I type "Buy bread" in the edit input
    And I blur the edit input
    Then todo "Buy bread" exists in the list

  Scenario: Empty edit destroys the todo
    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
    And I am editing todo "Buy milk"
    When I clear the edit input
    And I press Enter
    Then no todos exist in the list

  Scenario: Escape cancels edit
    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
    And I am editing todo "Buy milk"
    When I type "Changed" in the edit input
    And I press Escape
    Then todo "Buy milk" exists in the list
    And todo "Changed" does not exist
    And todo "Buy milk" does not have class "editing"

  Scenario: Edit input is trimmed
    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
    And I am editing todo "Buy milk"
    When I clear the edit input
    And I type "  Buy bread  " in the edit input
    And I press Enter
    Then todo "Buy bread" exists in the list

  Scenario: Toggle control is hidden when editing
    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
    When I double-click the label for todo "Buy milk"
    Then the toggle input for todo "Buy milk" is not visible

  Scenario: View label is hidden when editing
    Given I have a todo "Buy milk"
    When I double-click the label for todo "Buy milk"
    Then the view label for todo "Buy milk" has display "none"
---SEP---
Feature: Toggle all
  As a TodoMVC user
  I want to mark all todos as complete or active with one checkbox
  So that I can manage bulk state efficiently

  Scenario: Toggle all marks all todos complete
    Given I have todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
    When I check the toggle-all checkbox
    Then all todos are marked complete

  Scenario: Toggle all clears when all todos are cleared
    Given I have todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
    When I check the toggle-all checkbox
    And I click the clear completed button
    Then the toggle-all checkbox is unchecked

  Scenario: Complete all checkbox updates when items are completed and cleared
    Given I have todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
    When I click the checkbox for todo "Buy milk"
    And I click the checkbox for todo "Walk dog"
    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
    When I click the clear completed button
    Then the toggle-all checkbox is unchecked
